    523	> kind** for the entanglement-theoretic compressibility of chi_P. The
    524	> savings is only constant-factor phi(W)/W, so on its own it doesn't break
    525	> sqrt(x), but it gives an exact algebraic handle on the wheel-W sieve in
    526	> tensor-network language.
