  lines via L6 Hölder reduction + Möbius collapse). 1 session.
- **C9.a.iii** Λ-modulated divisor-only sum `μ²(q)λ(q)c_q(n)/φ(q)`
  — does the parity-twisted weight yield a closed-form scalar? 1
